flowchart TD
  PWR[上电] --> INIT[main初始化/InitUserData]
  INIT --> RTOS[创建任务/启动调度]
  RTOS --> MB[Modbus任务 USART3/USART6]
  RTOS --> PROC[ProcessControlTask]

  PROC --> MODE{nStartMode==1?}
  MODE -- 否 --> PROC
  MODE -- 是 --> IDLE[连续模式待机 nAutoRun=0]

  MB --> RX[收到Modbus写Holding寄存器]
  RX --> HOLD[eMBRegHoldingCB 写入nAutoRun]
  HOLD --> TRIG[nAutoRun>0]

  IDLE --> CHECK{ProcessControlTask检测nAutoRun>0}
  CHECK -- 否 --> IDLE
  CHECK -- 是 --> START[RW50=nAutoRun 清零nAutoRun AutoStep=1]
  START --> AR[AutoRun AutoStep状态机]

  AR --> STEPS[执行AutoStep 1..19]
  STEPS --> STEP20[AutoStep=20 模式收尾]
  STEP20 --> LOOP[连续模式 AutoStep=1]
  LOOP --> STEPS
